{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2016-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1462665600, "end_date": 1463356799, "month_true_total": 1069, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:05:16 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23011202", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057607742", "personaname": "EvolvedLegacy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EvolvedLegacy/", "num_games_owned": 374, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 30284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14448, "last_played": 1766974871, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very good game, would buy again", "timestamp_created": 1463356507, "timestamp_updated": 1463356507, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23010922", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150339964", "personaname": "Tdizzl3d", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tdizzl3d/", "num_games_owned": 322, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 32584, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 28489, "last_played": 1725624599, "avatar": "24ba482d6f7c5deb24b83228276ea55c374f0bb0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Exactly what it says on the box, the best milsim game out there, accept no substitutes. Of course, there aren't any other games that do everything Arma does, what with the editor and scripting and mods and such, but that's beside the point. \n\nThe campaigns are there, I guess, but the real fun comes from multiplayer. Find some friends or a group to play with and you will have a fantastic time. That said, the fantastic time you will be having will probably be spent:\n[list]\n    [*]Browsing the workshop.\n    [*]Playing soldier dress up simulator in the arsenal.\n    [*]Being briefed on the mission for the twentieth time.\n    [*]In a car/truck/apc/helicopter/boat/plane/pair of boots on your way to the AO.\n    [*]Lost.\n[/list]\nThen, after an hour or two you will make contact with the enemy. Your plan will go awry and, for a glorious five minutes there will be utter chaos. And that's what makes Arma worth it. That's why we tolerate the brain dead AI, the wonky vehicle physics and the ancient engine it all runs on. Because there is nothing more fun than an Arma mission gone wrong.", "timestamp_created": 1463355184, "timestamp_updated": 1556770295, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23010874", "author": {"steamid": "76561198269999760", "personaname": "dtuckk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198269999760/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 25362, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2135, "last_played": 1738144050, "avatar": "c40de7143265157ed92594d6ee8d01ceb8924de1"}, "language": "english", "review": "LOVED IT", "timestamp_created": 1463354970, "timestamp_updated": 1463354970, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23010710", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117662947", "personaname": "ImTheCollective", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76